 "findings": [
  {
   "evidence": "The `namespace Ear` block contains only `trace_open/closed`, `adjoin_open/closed`, `le_adjoin` and `trace_le_adjoin`. `disjoint_arrowSet` and the vertexSet/arrowSet lemmas exist only on `OpenEar`/`ClosedEar`, and `stage_succ : stage i.succ = (ear i).adjoin` is stated in terms of `Ear.adjoin`.",
   "file": "TauCeti/Combinatorics/Network/Ear/Basic.lean",
   "fix": "Add `adjoin_eq_sup_trace` for `OpenEar`, `ClosedEar` and `Ear` (or define `Ear.adjoin P := S \u2294 P.trace` directly). Add `@[simp] Ear.adjoin_vertexSet` and `Ear.adjoin_arrowSet` (in terms of `P.trace`), and `Ear.disjoint_arrowSet : Disjoint P.trace.arrowSet S.arrowSet`.",
   "issue": "`Ear.adjoin` and `Ear.trace` are defined by cases, and there is no `adjoin = S \u2294 trace` lemma (missing for `Ear`, and also for the unexposed `OpenEar.adjoin` and `ClosedEar.adjoin`). There are also no Ear-level `adjoin_vertexSet`/`adjoin_arrowSet` and no `Ear.disjoint_arrowSet`, so anything that rewrites `D.stage i.succ` through `stage_succ` must split on `.open`/`.closed`.",
   "line": 261
  }
